<style>
/* One visual world: a night-time stage over the city, single theme by choice.
   Layout: a fixed grid. Header on top, controls column left, map in the middle,
   numbers column right, time bar below. Nothing ever floats over the map. */
:root {
  --ink: #0b0e13;
  --panel: #12161d;
  --panel2: #171c25;
  --line: rgba(190, 204, 224, 0.14);
  --paper: #ece6da;
  --muted: #8f99a8;
  --heat: #ee8a45;
  --haze: #a8b4d8;
  --display: "Newsreader", "Iowan Old Style", "Palatino Linotype", Georgia, serif;
  --body: "IBM Plex Sans", "Segoe UI", system-ui, sans-serif;
  --mono: "IBM Plex Mono", ui-monospace, "Cascadia Mono", Consolas, monospace;
  color-scheme: dark;
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
[hidden] { display: none !important; }
html, body { height: 100%; margin: 0; }
body {
  background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper); font: 13.5px/1.45 var(--body); overflow: hidden;
  display: grid; gap: 8px; padding: 8px;
  grid-template-columns: 272px minmax(0, 1fr) 318px;
  grid-template-rows: auto minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
}
button { font: inherit; color: inherit; }
:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--heat); outline-offset: 2px; }
.panel { background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 6px; min-height: 0; }
.eyebrow { font: 500 10.5px/1.3 var(--mono); letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); }
.muted { color: var(--muted); }
.seg { display: inline-flex; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 4px; overflow: hidden; }
.seg button { background: transparent; border: 0; padding: 6px 11px; font-size: 12.5px; color: var(--muted); cursor: pointer; }
.seg button + button { border-left: 1px solid var(--line); }
.seg button[aria-pressed="true"] { background: rgba(236, 230, 218, 0.12); color: var(--paper); }
.btn { background: transparent; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 4px; padding: 6px 11px; font-size: 12.5px; cursor: pointer; color: var(--paper); }
.btn:hover { border-color: rgba(236, 230, 218, 0.4); }
.btn.primary { background: var(--paper); color: #14161a; border-color: var(--paper); }
.src { display: inline-block; font: 500 9.5px/1 var(--mono); letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 3px 5px; border-radius: 3px; vertical-align: 1px; white-space: nowrap; }
.src.meas { background: rgba(110, 180, 140, 0.18); color: #9fd7b3; }
.src.rean { background: rgba(140, 160, 210, 0.18); color: #b6c3ea; }
.src.model { background: rgba(238, 138, 69, 0.16); color: #f2b07f; }

/* header */
#top { grid-column: 1 / -1; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; padding: 5px 12px; }
#top .brand { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; margin-right: auto; }
#top .brand b { font: 500 18px/1.1 var(--display); }

/* left column */
#left { grid-column: 1; grid-row: 2; overflow-y: auto; padding: 12px 14px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; }
#siteName { font: 500 19px/1.15 var(--display); margin: 3px 0 4px; }
#siteMeta { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); }
.layers { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1px; }
.layers button { text-align: left; background: transparent; border: 0; border-left: 2px solid transparent; padding: 5px 8px; cursor: pointer; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }
.layers button[aria-pressed="true"] { color: var(--paper); border-left-color: var(--heat); background: rgba(236, 230, 218, 0.05); }
.layers button:disabled { opacity: 0.35; cursor: not-allowed; }
.whatif label { display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: flex-start; font-size: 12.5px; padding: 3px 0; cursor: pointer; }
.whatif input { accent-color: var(--heat); margin-top: 3px; }
#scenStatus { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 4px; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
#scenStatus b { color: var(--paper); font-weight: 500; }

/* walkthrough panel (replaces controls in the left column) */
#controls { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; }
#tourPanel { display: none; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
body.touring #tourPanel { display: flex; }
body.touring #controls { display: none; }
#capEye { color: var(--heat); }
#capText { font: 400 18px/1.38 var(--display); text-wrap: pretty; }
.capnav { display: flex; gap: 6px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
#tourCount { font: 11px var(--mono); color: var(--muted); margin-right: auto; }
#yearChart { width: 100%; height: 150px; display: block; }
.yk { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px 12px; font: 10px var(--mono); color: var(--muted); }
.yk i { display: inline-block; width: 10px; height: 3px; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 5px; }

/* map */
#stageWrap { grid-column: 2; grid-row: 2; position: relative; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid var(--line); min-height: 0; }
#stage { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; cursor: grab; }
#stage:active { cursor: grabbing; }
#labels { position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none; overflow: hidden; }
.lm { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; font: 10.5px var(--mono); color: #fff4d6; white-space: nowrap; letter-spacing: 0.03em; text-shadow: 0 1px 3px #000, 0 0 8px #000; }
.lm i { display: inline-block; width: 6px; height: 6px; border: 1px solid #fff4d6; border-radius: 50%; margin: 0 5px 0 -3px; }
#sunLabel, #northLabel { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; font: 11.5px var(--mono); color: #ffd27a; white-space: nowrap; pointer-events: none; text-shadow: 0 1px 3px #000, 0 0 8px #000; }
#northLabel { color: #dfe5ee; font-weight: 500; }
body.intro #northLabel, body.intro #sunLabel { display: none; }
#lidLabel { position: absolute; left: 0; top: 0; font: 11.5px var(--mono); color: #e4e9ff; white-space: nowrap; pointer-events: none; text-shadow: 0 1px 3px #000; margin-top: -20px; }
#mapNote { position: absolute; left: 10px; bottom: 8px; font: 10.5px var(--mono); color: rgba(220, 226, 236, 0.6); pointer-events: none; text-shadow: 0 1px 2px #000; }
#tip { position: fixed; z-index: 30; pointer-events: none; background: rgba(10, 12, 16, 0.95); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 4px; padding: 7px 9px; font-size: 12px; max-width: 260px; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
#tip span { color: var(--muted); }

/* right column */
#right { grid-column: 3; grid-row: 2; overflow-y: auto; padding: 12px 14px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
#right h2 { font: 500 17px/1.2 var(--display); margin: 2px 0 0; }
#right p.sub { margin: 2px 0 0; font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); }
.keys { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
.key { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; gap: 2px 10px; padding: 7px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
.key .k { font-size: 12.5px; }
.key .v { font: 500 16px/1.1 var(--display); text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; white-space: nowrap; }
.key .s { grid-column: 1 / -1; font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); }
.pr-item { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 18px 1fr auto; gap: 8px; align-items: center; width: 100%; text-align: left; background: transparent; border: 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 7px 2px; cursor: pointer; }
.pr-item:hover { background: rgba(236, 230, 218, 0.04); }
.pr-n { font: 11px var(--mono); color: var(--muted); }
.pr-body { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1px; }
.pr-title { font-size: 13px; }
.pr-sub { font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.pr-score { font: 500 17px var(--display); color: var(--heat); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
#prioDetail:empty { display: none; }
#prioDetail { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-top: 8px; }
.pd-title { font: 500 15px var(--display); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; }
.pd-title span { font: 11px var(--mono); color: var(--heat); }
#prioDetail p { font-size: 12.5px; margin: 5px 0; }

/* building brief (in the right column) */
#rightDefault { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
#brief { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
.bf-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px; align-items: flex-start; }
.bf-title { font: 500 18px/1.15 var(--display); text-wrap: balance; }
.bf-meta { font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 3px; }
.bf-close { background: transparent; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 4px; color: var(--muted); cursor: pointer; padding: 3px 8px; font-size: 12px; }
.bf-lead { font-size: 13px; margin: 0; }
.bf-lead b { color: var(--heat); font-weight: 500; }
#briefChart { width: 100%; display: block; }
.bf-roof { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 8px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-top: 8px; }
.bf-roof div { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.bf-roof span { font-size: 10.5px; color: var(--muted); }
.bf-roof b { font: 500 16px var(--display); }
.bf-note { font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); }

/* bottom bar */
#bottom { grid-column: 1 / -1; grid-row: 3; padding: 7px 12px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 210px minmax(0, 1fr) 270px; gap: 18px; align-items: stretch; }
#readout { font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
.ro-time { font: 500 20px/1 var(--display); margin-bottom: 6px; }
.ro-time span { font: 11px var(--mono); color: var(--muted); margin-left: 5px; }
.ro-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; font-size: 12px; padding: 1px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
.ro-row span { color: var(--muted); }
.tl-head { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px 14px; font-size: 11.5px; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 2px; }
.tl-head i { display: inline-block; width: 14px; height: 2px; vertical-align: middle; margin-right: 5px; }
.tl-head i.dash { background: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, currentColor 0 4px, transparent 4px 7px) !important; height: 2px; }
#timeline { width: 100%; height: 82px; display: block; }
.timebar { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-top: 4px; }
#hour { flex: 1; accent-color: var(--heat); }
#hourLabel { font: 500 13px var(--mono); width: 44px; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
#legend { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; justify-content: center; }
.lg-name { font: 500 14px var(--display); }
.lg-bar { height: 10px; border-radius: 2px; }
.lg-ticks { position: relative; height: 13px; font: 10px var(--mono); color: var(--muted); }
.lg-ticks span { position: absolute; top: 0; transform: translateX(-50%); white-space: nowrap; }
.lg-ticks span:first-child { transform: none; }
.lg-ticks span:last-child { transform: translateX(-100%); }
.lg-note { font-size: 11.5px; color: #b9c0cb; line-height: 1.4; }

/* method */
#method { position: fixed; inset: 56px 14% 40px 14%; z-index: 40; padding: 22px 26px; overflow-y: auto; background: #12161d; box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6); }
#method h2 { font: 500 26px/1.15 var(--display); margin: 6px 0 12px; }
#method h3 { font: 500 16px var(--display); margin: 18px 0 6px; }
#method p, #method li { max-width: 72ch; font-size: 13.5px; }
#method a { color: var(--haze); }
#method table { border-collapse: collapse; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; font-size: 13px; margin-top: 6px; }
#method td, #method th { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 5px 14px 5px 0; text-align: left; }
#method th { font: 500 10.5px var(--mono); color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; }

/* title screen: map fills the window behind it */
body.intro #top, body.intro #left, body.intro #right, body.intro #bottom { display: none; }
body.intro #stageWrap { grid-column: 1 / -1; grid-row: 1 / -1; border: 0; }
body.intro #mapNote { display: none; }
#intro { position: fixed; inset: 0; z-index: 50; display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 600px) 1fr; padding: 6vh 6vw; background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(11, 14, 19, 0.97) 0%, rgba(11, 14, 19, 0.86) 42%, rgba(11, 14, 19, 0.1) 78%, rgba(11, 14, 19, 0) 100%); }
#intro .inner { display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; gap: 15px; }
#intro h1 { font: 400 clamp(52px, 7.5vw, 100px)/0.95 var(--display); margin: 0; letter-spacing: -0.015em; }
#intro .rule { width: 64px; height: 2px; background: var(--heat); }
.tagline { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; }
.tagline .en { font: italic 400 clamp(22px, 2.3vw, 30px)/1.2 var(--display); color: var(--heat); }
#intro p.lead { font-size: 15.5px; line-height: 1.55; max-width: 48ch; margin: 0; color: #cfc9be; }
#intro .actions { display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
#intro .actions button { padding: 11px 18px; border-radius: 3px; font-size: 14px; cursor: pointer; }
#startTour { background: var(--paper); color: #14161a; border: 1px solid var(--paper); font-weight: 500; }
#startMap { background: transparent; border: 1px solid rgba(236, 230, 218, 0.4); color: var(--paper); }
#intro button:disabled { opacity: 0.45; cursor: progress; }
#bootStatus { font: 11px var(--mono); color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: 0.06em; min-height: 14px; }
.credit { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-top: 10px; max-width: 520px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; }
.credit .names { font-size: 14px; }
.credit .names b { font-weight: 500; }
.credit .meta { font: 11px var(--mono); color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: 0.04em; }

@media (max-width: 1150px) {
  body { grid-template-columns: 250px minmax(0, 1fr) 0; }
  #right { display: none; }
  body.brief-open #right { display: flex; position: fixed; right: 8px; top: 64px; bottom: 170px; width: 318px; z-index: 20; box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.5); }
  #bottom { grid-template-columns: 190px minmax(0, 1fr) 220px; }
  #method { inset: 50px 16px; }
}
@media (max-width: 760px) {
  body { grid-template-columns: 1fr; grid-template-rows: auto 52vh auto auto; overflow-y: auto; height: auto; }
  #left, #stageWrap, #bottom { grid-column: 1; }
  #stageWrap { grid-row: 2; } #left { grid-row: 3; } #bottom { grid-row: 4; grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  #intro { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding: 5vh 20px; }
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { * { transition: none !important; animation: none !important; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="tip" hidden></div>

<header id="top" class="panel">
  <div class="brand"><span class="eyebrow">GIS Day 2026 · Lahore</span><b>The Lahore Canyon</b></div>
  <div class="seg" role="group" aria-label="Study area"><button data-site="walled" aria-pressed="true">Walled City</button><button data-site="dha" aria-pressed="false">DHA Phase 2</button></div>
  <div class="seg" role="group" aria-label="Day"><button data-day="heat" aria-pressed="true">Hottest day · 10 Jun</button><button data-day="smog" aria-pressed="false">Smog night · 10 Nov</button></div>
  <button class="btn" id="openMethod">Data &amp; method</button>
  <button class="btn" id="backIntro">Title</button>
</header>

<aside id="left" class="panel">
  <div id="controls">
    <div><div class="eyebrow">Study area</div><div id="siteName">Walled City</div><div id="siteMeta"></div></div>
    <div><div class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:5px">What the colours show</div>
      <div class="layers">
        <button data-layer="temp" aria-pressed="true">Hotter or cooler (model)</button>
        <button data-layer="sun" aria-pressed="false">Sun or shade</button>
        <button data-layer="sky" aria-pressed="false">How much sky it sees</button>
        <button data-layer="dose" aria-pressed="false">Hours of direct sun</button>
        <button data-layer="vent" aria-pressed="false">How fast smog can clear</button>
        <button data-layer="prio" aria-pressed="false">Where to act first</button>
      </div></div>
    <div class="whatif"><div class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:5px">What if</div>
      <label for="wCool"><input type="checkbox" id="wCool"> Paint roofs white (lime wash)</label>
      <label for="wShade"><input type="checkbox" id="wShade"> Shade the streets (trees or awnings)</label>
      <div id="scenStatus">Showing today.</div></div>
  </div>
  <div id="tourPanel" aria-live="polite">
    <div class="eyebrow" id="capEye"></div>
    <div id="capText"></div>
    <div class="capnav"><span id="tourCount"></span><button class="btn" id="tourPrev">Back</button><button class="btn primary" id="tourNext">Next</button></div>
    <button class="btn" id="tourExit">Leave the walkthrough and explore</button>
    <div id="yearCard" hidden>
      <div class="eyebrow">Lahore · Nov 2025 – Nov 2026</div>
      <canvas id="yearChart"></canvas>
      <div class="yk"><span><i style="background:#ee8a45"></i>Average daily max °C</span><span><i style="background:#d4473f;height:6px;width:6px;border-radius:50%"></i>Hottest day of month</span><span><i style="background:rgba(201,178,138,0.6);height:8px"></i>PM2.5 µg/m³</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</aside>

<main id="stageWrap">
  <canvas id="stage" aria-label="3D model of surface temperatures in Lahore"></canvas>
  <div id="labels"></div>
  <div id="lidLabel" hidden></div>
  <div id="sunLabel" hidden></div>
  <div id="northLabel">N ↑</div>
  <div id="mapNote">Drag to rotate · scroll to zoom · click a building for its floor-by-floor brief</div>
</main>

<aside id="right" class="panel">
  <div id="rightDefault">
    <div><div class="eyebrow" id="keysEye">Key numbers</div><h2 id="keysTitle">Walled City</h2>
      <p class="sub"><span class="src meas">Measured</span> satellite · <span class="src rean">Weather</span> ERA5/CAMS · <span class="src model">Calculated</span> from building shapes</p></div>
    <div class="keys" id="keys"></div>
    <div><div class="eyebrow">Heat season · 10 Jun 2026</div><h2>Where to act first</h2>
      <p class="sub">Each 40 m block scored 0–100 from how hot the model ranks it and its floor space (more floor space, more people). Click one to fly there.</p></div>
    <div id="prioList"></div>
    <div id="prioDetail"></div>
  </div>
  <div id="brief" hidden>
    <div class="bf-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">Building brief · floor by floor</div><div class="bf-title"></div><div class="bf-meta"></div></div><button class="bf-close">Close</button></div>
    <p class="bf-lead"></p>
    <div class="eyebrow">Exposed walls · hotter or cooler (model) and hours of sun</div>
    <canvas id="briefChart"></canvas>
    <div class="bf-roof"></div>
    <div class="bf-note">Sun hours and sky share are calculated from the real building heights. The hotter/cooler bars are model estimates, shown as a comparison only.</div>
  </div>
</aside>

<section id="bottom" class="panel">
  <div id="readout"></div>
  <div><div class="tl-head" id="tlHead"></div><canvas id="timeline" aria-label="24-hour chart"></canvas>
    <div class="timebar"><button class="btn" id="play" aria-pressed="false">Play day</button><label for="hour" class="eyebrow">Hour</label><input type="range" id="hour" min="0" max="23" step="1" value="15"><span id="hourLabel">15:00</span></div></div>
  <div id="legend"></div>
</section>

<section id="method" class="panel" hidden>
  <div class="bf-head"><div class="eyebrow">Data &amp; method</div><button class="bf-close">Close</button></div>
  <h2>How the Lahore Canyon is built</h2>
  <p>Two 1.2 × 1.2 km areas on a 4 m grid: the Walled City around Rang Mahal, and DHA Phase 2. Every outside wall is cut into storey-high panels, and every roof and street cell is a surface. For each one, the model works out how much open sky it sees, whether it is in direct sun at each hour (by tracing the sun's rays across the 3D buildings), and how hot it gets from sun, air temperature, wind and the heat given off by its surroundings. The "What if" options rerun that calculation in your browser.</p>
  <h3>Data</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Building heights: Google Open Buildings 2.5D Temporal, 2023 layer, 4 m resolution. <a href="https://developers.google.com/earth-engine/datasets/catalog/GOOGLE_Research_open-buildings-temporal_v1">Dataset</a></li>
    <li>Surface temperature and vegetation: Landsat 8 Collection 2 Level-2, scene 149/038, 7 Jun 2026 10:35 PKT, via Microsoft Planetary Computer. <a href="https://planetarycomputer.microsoft.com/dataset/landsat-c2-l2">Dataset</a></li>
    <li>Hourly weather (air temperature, humidity, sunshine, wind, height of the mixing layer): ERA5 reanalysis via the Open-Meteo archive. <a href="https://open-meteo.com/en/docs/historical-weather-api">API</a></li>
    <li>PM2.5: CAMS air-quality model via Open-Meteo. These are model estimates, not station readings. <a href="https://open-meteo.com/en/docs/air-quality-api">API</a></li>
    <li>Landmark names: © OpenStreetMap contributors. <a href="https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright">Licence</a></li>
  </ul>
  <h3>Checked against the satellite</h3>
  <p>The model was compared with two satellites. One setting was tuned against Landsat: how much sunlight surfaces absorb (walls 0.69, roofs 0.81, ground 0.92, typical of brick, plaster and dusty asphalt). Afternoon cooling by rising hot air uses ERA5's boundary-layer height.</p>
  <table><thead><tr><th>Check</th><th>Area</th><th>Model</th><th>Satellite</th></tr></thead>
  <tbody><tr><td>Landsat 8, 7 Jun, 10:35 am, 30 m</td><td>Walled City</td><td>51.3 °C</td><td>51.6 °C</td></tr>
  <tr><td></td><td>DHA Phase 2</td><td>49.1 °C</td><td>50.1 °C</td></tr>
  <tr><td>MODIS Aqua, 10 Jun, 4:30 am, 1 km</td><td>Walled City</td><td>28.5 °C</td><td>27.1 °C</td></tr>
  <tr><td></td><td>DHA Phase 2</td><td>28.8 °C</td><td>27.6 °C</td></tr>
  <tr><td>MODIS Aqua, 10 Jun, 2:48 pm, 1 km</td><td>Walled City</td><td>62.7 °C</td><td>42.3 °C</td></tr>
  <tr><td></td><td>DHA Phase 2</td><td>60.2 °C</td><td>44.1 °C</td></tr></tbody></table>
  <p>Morning and night agree within about 1.5 °C. The afternoon does not: the model is far hotter than MODIS. Part of the gap is the sensor (MODIS averages 1 km and also reads about 10 °C below Landsat in the morning), but MODIS also shows surfaces warming only 1–3 °C between morning and afternoon, while the model warms them much more. So the afternoon figures in this app are upper estimates. The patterns (which surfaces, floors and streets are hotter than others) are the reliable part.</p>
  <h3>What is measured and what is modelled</h3>
  <p>Every temperature in degrees shown in this app is measured or comes from weather records: Landsat 8 and MODIS for the ground surface, ERA5 for the air. No satellite can measure a single wall or roof, so for those the model is used only to compare: which surfaces, floors and streets run hotter or cooler than others, and by roughly how much. Sun and shade, hours of sun and sky share are calculated directly from the real building heights and the sun's position.</p>
  <h3>Limits</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Air temperature and wind come from one 9 km ERA5 cell, the same for both areas. The app maps surface heat, not the air temperature a person feels.</li>
    <li>Building heights are machine-learning estimates. Lanes narrower than about 4 m are not resolved.</li>
    <li>Night-time figures are model results; the satellite check is daytime only.</li>
    <li>"How fast smog can clear" is based on how open each street is to the sky. It is not a pollution simulation.</li>
    <li>Floor space stands in for residents; no population data was used.</li>
  </ul>
  <h3>Credits</h3>
  <p>Developed by <b>Muhammad Mehdi</b> &amp; <b>Hussain Ahmad</b>, BS Geography, 7th Semester (Morning), for GIS Day 2026, Lahore.</p>
</section>

